  "question": {
    "text": "A rubber ball is dropped from a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> on a plane. It bounces back to a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. Find the coefficient of the restitution for the collision."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If the ball is dropped from height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;and bounces back to height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>h</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
  }
